  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>X</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math>&nbsp;in the given functional equation, we get&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>X</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Replacing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is the constant of integration.</p>",
